h","text":"→たくさんじゃなくても全然いいよ〜！来てくれるだけで元気をもらえる(*´`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆなも元気をあげられるように頑張らないと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・あと、ちょうど残り2ヶ月やけど誕生日までの短期目標ってなんかある？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→可愛くなる！すぐ泣かない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・今直感で出てきた食べ物は！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→お鍋！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のおばあちゃん家の夜ご飯がお鍋だったからだよ(･-･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お年玉何に使うか決めた〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→今年も貯金する〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、欲しいものができたら使っちゃう(˙-˙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ゆんちゃんはメンバーと一緒にカラオケ行ったりする〜？？行くなら誰と行く〜？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→かっきーと一回だけ行ったことある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・テンションあげたいときに聞く乃木坂46の曲あったら教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→空扉、その先の出口、空気感 を聞きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・山下美月さんの写真集買いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→はい、もちろん買います！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家に先輩方の写真集がたくさんあります(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お年玉は貰った〜？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→今年はまだ貰いました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも「あげなさい」って言われちゃった(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ゆんちゃんが暮らしたい国はどこですか？笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→アメリカのサンフランシスコかハワイ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に行ったことがあるから住んでみたいなと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・柚菜ちゃんは目覚ましを何回もかける派？？それとも1発で起きれる派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→気が張ってる時は一発で起きれるけど、普段は何回もかけてゆっくり起きる( ˶´-`˵ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・早く柚菜に会いたくてしんどいんだけど...。この気持ちどうすればいい？(๑´• ₃ •̀๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ゆなも早く会いたいよ〜( ._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・かっきーと年越ししてたみたいだけど、年越しの瞬間はジャンプしましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→したした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お正月は、おばあちゃん家で過ごしたと思うけど、美味しいものたくさん食べたんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→たくさん食べたよ( ˶´ `˵ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type