411/mobrMyeuM.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202411/mobJwlSAA.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にたくさんたくさん写真撮ったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今夜22:45〜日向坂ちゃんねるにて「副キャプテン&重大発表生配信」がありますよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"URL\n【https://www.youtube.com/live/YFATbUISvlA?feature=shared】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"副キャプテンは日向坂にとって初めての事だからとっても気になるよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重大発表も要チェックです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますっ👌🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202411/mobfuj8o3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■金村美玖公式Instagram📸\nhttps://www.instagram.com/miku_osushi/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■1st写真集「羅針盤」発売中！\nhttps://linktr.ee/mikukanemura"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nsee you later✩.*˚#543"}],"source":"official"}}